        // Current sum is x + y.
        // If x + y > z, no increments needed.
        // If x + y <= z, we need to add (z + 1 - (x + y)) to the sum of x and y.
        // Since we can distribute these increments arbitrarily between x and y,
        // the total number of minutes is simply the difference.

